# There's also an important Postiz edge case

Sometimes a platform successfully publishes something but Postiz doesn't receive/retain a usable platform release ID.

Their CLI documentation explicitly has commands for this situation:

```text
posts:missing
posts:connect
```

because post analytics require that published object to be associated with the real platform object. ([GitHub][6])

So our ingestion system should track:

```text
content_id
postiz_post_id
platform_release_id
release_url
analytics_status
```

and surface:

```text
⚠ YouTube publication has no release ID
```

rather than silently losing analytics.

