# 4. Cross-platform adaptation

We should be able to distinguish:

```text
CONTENT QUALITY
```

from:

```text
PLATFORM FIT
```

Example:

```text
RAPTOR SWARM

                   views     relative performance

YouTube             82k          1.7× channel norm
TikTok             611k          4.1× channel norm
Instagram          139k          2.2× channel norm
```

That tells us:

> strong concept everywhere, especially TikTok.

Versus:

```text
DINOSAUR TIMELINE

YouTube            210k          3.9×
TikTok              18k          0.3×
Instagram           31k          0.5×
```

That means:

> good content; wrong short-form packaging.

That's far more useful than a generic engagement dashboard.

