# 5. Publishing operations

This dashboard should also replace staring at logs.

Something like:

```text
PUBLICATION QUEUE

✓ prehistoric-043
  YT       published
  TT       published
  IG       published

△ roboblades-018
  YT       published
  TT       retrying
  IG       published

✗ ocean-011
  YT       failed
  reason: media validation

○ prehistoric-044
  scheduled 09:00
```

This matters because multi-platform publishing **will fail partially**.

Meta and TikTok occasionally alter API behavior, and recent Postiz issues illustrate exactly these kinds of platform-specific integration failures. ([GitHub][9])

We need partial failure to be a first-class state:

```text
content publish ≠ boolean
```

It is:

```text
publication
    ├── YouTube: success
    ├── Instagram: success
    └── TikTok: failed/retry
```

