# I would also store BOTH raw and normalized metrics

Never:

```text
views = 92137
```

only.

Instead:

```text
source              tiktok
native_metric       view_count
native_value        92137

normalized_metric   views
normalized_value    92137

observed_at         ...
```

Because later we might decide:

```text
TikTok views ≠ YouTube views
```

for some analytical model.

Then we can change normalization without rewriting history.

